{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109669","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109669/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109669/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109669/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109669","id":3327209189,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7GUS7l","number":109669,"title":"GDScript warnings treated as errors don't exclude custom editor theme","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-08-16T11:56:01Z","updated_at":"2025-08-16T18:03:43Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.5.beta5.official [c81fd6c51]\nbut was always the case\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta5 - macOS Sequoia (15.1.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 Max (Apple7) - Apple M1 Max (10 threads) - 32.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf a custom editor theme embeds gdscript (which [minimal theme](https://github.com/passivestar/godot-minimal-theme) relies on to support editor settings) it gets affected by project settings under `gdscript/warnings/`. It should be exempt from those because editor theme is not project-specific and supporting all of those warnings as errors makes theme generation code unnecessary verbose and can get in the way of supporting certain things\n\nSee https://github.com/passivestar/godot-minimal-theme/issues/16 and https://github.com/passivestar/godot-minimal-theme/issues/48\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nReproduce https://github.com/passivestar/godot-minimal-theme/issues/48 with https://github.com/passivestar/godot-minimal-theme/releases/tag/2.3.3\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109669/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109669/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}